            "review_title": "Review at Sanriku Hanoi - Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jeff W\n19 contributions\n0\nGreat sushi & sashimi\nMar 2019 • Couples\nI eat here regularly with my wife. The quality of the fish is stable and better than most sushi restaurants, well worth the price! It is one of our favorite sushi and sashimi restaurants. I also enjoy the ebi tempura and rice tea, grilled salmon, soba, udon and grilled saba. Well worth the visit!\nWritten March 4, 2019",
